('UK:truck-driver','2026-08-10',null,null,39141,0,0,0,0,15,6,0,0,2,23,'career-opportunity-uk-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 8211 Heavy and large goods vehicle drivers.','shortage_note','No recurring occupation-specific shortage finding is used; general haulage recruitment pressure is not converted into shortage points.','visa_basis','SOC 8211 is in Home Office Table 6 and is not eligible for Skilled Worker sponsorship; 0/10.','salary_method','Stored ONS ASHE 2025 provisional occupation median GBP 39,141; no Skilled Worker going rate applies; 6/10.','entry_basis','Approved Level 2 LGV Driver C+E route; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','Appropriate vocational licence entitlement and Driver CPC are required for professional LGV driving; 2/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('UK:logistics-coordinator','2026-08-10',null,17.13,33400,0,0,0,0,15,4,0,3,5,27,'career-opportunity-uk-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 4134/00 Transport and distribution clerks and assistants — Transport Coordinator scope; excludes logistics managers SOC 1243 and stock-control SOC 4133.','shortage_note','No direct occupation-specific shortage finding is used.','visa_basis','SOC 4134 is RQF 3-5 and not on the current TSL; new-overseas Skilled Worker access is generally restricted while qualifying transitional access can remain; 3/10.','salary_method','Home Office going rate GBP 33,400 / GBP 17.13 per hour; 4/10.','entry_basis','Direct Level 3 Transport Operations Supervisor route explicitly includes Transport Coordinator; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','No universal statutory personal licence; 5/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('UK:aircraft-maintenance-technician','2026-08-10',14000,23.08,45000,0,0,0,0,15,8,0,3,2,28,'career-opportunity-uk-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Core mapping is SOC 5234/00 Aircraft maintenance and related trades; Skills England also recognises adjacent 3112/01 avionics and 3113/01 aerospace technician sub-units, but their immigration treatment is not borrowed for the core score.','shortage_note','MAC July 2026 Stage 2 found very limited shortage evidence for SOC 5234 and recommended no TSL access; 0/20.','visa_basis','Core SOC 5234 is RQF 3-5 and is not on the current interim TSL; qualifying transitional access can remain; 3/10.','salary_method','Home Office going rate GBP 45,000 / GBP 23.08 per hour; 8/10.','entry_basis','Approved Level 3 Aircraft Maintenance Technician route; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','Certifying functions can require a UK CAA Part-66 Aircraft Maintenance Licence and ratings; 2/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('UK:commercial-pilot','2026-08-10',null,41.23,80400,0,0,0,0,4,10,0,5,1,20,'career-opportunity-uk-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 3511 Aircraft pilots and air traffic controllers — commercial aeroplane/airline pilot scope.','shortage_note','No occupation-wide pilot shortage score is inferred in the current v1 evidence set.','visa_basis','SOC 3511 is RQF 6+ with standard Skilled Worker access; 5/10.','salary_method','Current Home Office Table 1 going rate GBP 80,400 / GBP 41.23 per hour; 10/10.','entry_basis','Professional flight training and experience pathway is high-cost and high-barrier; 4/15.','entry_burden_basis','CAA CPL/ATPL privileges require professional licensing, appropriate ratings and a valid Class 1 medical; 1/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('UK:marine-engineer','2026-08-10',7000,29.90,58300,20,0,0,0,15,10,0,3,4,52,'career-opportunity-uk-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 3512/02 Marine engineers — maritime engineering scope; Mechanical Engineer SOC 2122 is excluded.','shortage_note','MAC 23 July 2026 Stage 2 found strong shortage evidence and a clear shortfall of domestic workers in SOC 3512 and recommended access for 18 months; 20/20.','visa_basis','The current Immigration Rules updated 1 July 2026 have not yet added SOC 3512 to the legal TSL; as an RQF 3-5 occupation, new-overseas access remains generally restricted; 3/10.','salary_method','Home Office going rate GBP 58,300 / GBP 29.90 per hour; 10/10.','entry_basis','Approved Level 3 Marine Engineer route; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','Broad marine-engineer work is not universally registered, though seagoing engineer-officer functions can require MCA CoC; 4/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
('UK:deck-officer','2026-08-10',7000,29.90,58300,20,0,0,0,15,10,0,3,1,49,'career-opportunity-uk-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','SOC 3512/01 Ship and hovercraft captains and deck officers — deck officer/Officer of the Watch scope.','shortage_note','MAC 23 July 2026 Stage 2 found strong shortage evidence in SOC 3512 and recommended access for 18 months; 20/20.','visa_basis','SOC 3512 is not yet on the legal TSL in the current 1 July 2026 Immigration Rules, so current new-overseas access remains generally restricted; 3/10.','salary_method','Home Office going rate GBP 58,300 / GBP 29.90 per hour; 10/10.','entry_basis','Approved Level 3 Officer of the Watch route; 15/15.','entry_burden_basis','MCA examinations and Certificate of Competency are required to practise as an Officer of the Watch; 1/5.'),'2026-08-10'),
